COMPND   8 OTHER_DETAILS: 13-RESIDUE PEPTIDE OF THE PAM4 MOTIF OF TAU,          
COMPND   9 CORRESPONDING TO RESIDUES 350-362 OF THE TAU REPEAT DOMAIN. THE      
COMPND  10 PEPTIDE IS C-TERMINALLY AMIDATED AND SHOULD HAVE BEEN N-TERMINALLY   
